# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Ad Manager (GAM) — GPT tag configuration.
#
# Master switch. Leave it empty (or false) to ship the site with no ad script
# at all; every ad slot disappears and the Continue / Connect / clip buttons
# navigate straight away. Set it to `true` to turn ads on.
VITE_GAM_ENABLED=

# Ad unit paths, managed here so you can swap test for production without
# touching code. The values below are Google's official sample/test units, so
# they render without a live GAM account — good for local testing.
# Top banner shown on every screen.
VITE_GAM_BANNER_AD_UNIT=/21775744923/example/banner
# Interstitial fired on Continue and when a clip card is tapped.
VITE_GAM_INTERSTITIAL_AD_UNIT=/21775744923/example/interstitial
# Rewarded ad fired on the Connect button.
VITE_GAM_REWARDED_AD_UNIT=/22639388115/rewarded_web_example
# Anchor ad pinned to the bottom of the viewport.
VITE_GAM_ANCHOR_AD_UNIT=/21775744923/example/adaptive-banner
